t, surveillance software in its various forms has created a multibillion-do=
llar industry. But some, like Predator, may be taking espionage too far.
              =09</span>
              =09<span style=3D"display: block; margin-top: 30px">
              =09=09WhoisXML API researchers, aided by WHOIS, IP, and DNS t=
ools, took an in-depth look at Predator's digital footprint to find out if =
it is indeed legal as it touts to be. Our investigation on 21 email address=
es belonging to Predator's creator Cytrox led to the discovery of additiona=
l artifacts that could have ties to the Predator infrastructure, reiteratin=
g its malicious nature.
